,{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,R,s,t\">\\(Q,R,s,t\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8861f03dfc6f3503\" href=\"?note=8861f03dfc6f3503\" title=\"73-df-generalized-automaton-language\">73-df-generalized-automaton-language</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in Q\\setminus\\{s,t\\}\">\\(k\\in Q\\setminus\\{s,t\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in Q\\setminus\\{k\\}\">\\(i,j\\in Q\\setminus\\{k\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q&#39;\\coloneqq Q\\setminus\\{k\\},\\qquad\nR&#39;(i,j)\\coloneqq R(i,j)+(R(i,k)\\cdot R(k,k)^\\star)\\cdot R(k,j),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Elim}_k(Q,R,s,t)\\coloneqq(Q&#39;,R&#39;,s,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q&#39;\\coloneqq Q\\setminus\\{k\\},\\qquad\nR&#39;(i,j)\\coloneqq R(i,j)+(R(i,k)\\cdot R(k,k)^\\star)\\cdot R(k,j),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Elim}_k(Q,R,s,t)\\coloneqq(Q&#39;,R&#39;,s,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个新标签只读取旧标签，须同时更新，不能把刚算出的边再次用于同一次消元。k 不能是保留的起点或终点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-generalized-automaton-language","status":"resolved","id":"8861f03dfc6f3503","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-generalized-automaton-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-generalized-automaton-language","status":"resolved","id":"8861f03dfc6f3503","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q,R,s,t$ 采用 [[73-df-generalized-automaton-language]]，$k\\in Q\\setminus\\{s,t\\}$，$i,j\\in Q\\setminus\\{k\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"Q,R,s,t","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in Q\\setminus\\{s,t\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in Q\\setminus\\{k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Q'\\coloneqq Q\\setminus\\{k\\},\\qquad\nR'(i,j)\\coloneqq R(i,j)+(R(i,k)\\cdot R(k,k)^\\star)\\cdot R(k,j),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Elim}_k(Q,R,s,t)\\coloneqq(Q',R',s,t).","display":true}],"bytes":1221,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-generalized-state-elimination|消去一个状态的正则项更新]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"17d4ee5ab5516bc4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[73-df-generalized-state-elimination]] 的输入与输出 $(Q',R',s,t)$。"}],"outgoing":["8861f03dfc6f3503"]}